    ✔ Player.sync.npcs.streamedIn: List of npcs that are streamed in for player (Array<new NPC>) @done(23-03-03 17:43)
    ✔ Player.sync.npcs.netOwnerOf: List of npcs that player is net owner of (Array<NpcId>) @done(23-03-03 17:43)
  
  When player enters npc stream range, he gets a command to become
  net owner of the npc. When player leaves npc stream range, ownership
  is transfered to one of the closest players with lowest ping. If
  there are no players in stream range, ownership is transfered to
  server.
  When player becomes owner of npc, he reports npc state to server
  and server directs npc behavior to all players in stream range.
  When players in stream range attack npc, they report the damage
  to the server and server reports the damage to all players in
  stream range.
  A continuous check is made by the npc net owner to sync npc state
  with server because of possible desyncs on other players.
